This file contains the change history for the Casper application.

Not all of these releases were made public, but their changes are listed
for reference.

People who assisted with new information on a bug are listed in brackets.

---------------------------
v1.0.1 - 5th September 2002
---------------------------

- Stack imbalance around _TCPIPAcceptTCP - Fixed (Andrew Roughan)
- Directory location from where pages are loaded from is now displayed
 when starting up.

--------------------
v1.0 - 20th May 2001
--------------------

- Initial release as open source

